<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hermĭŏnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hermĭŏna</span></b> , ae,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμιόνη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Daughter of Menelāus and Helen</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. P. 2,
				11, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 122</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 1, 4,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3, 328
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A maritime city of Argolis</i>, now <i>Kastri</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 31,
				41, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5, 9, §
			18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hermĭŏnēus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Hermione</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">statio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. Cir. 471</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hermĭŏnĭus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., the same: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					4, 12, 19, § 56</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hermĭŏnĭcus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., the same: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					31, 44, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
